{
    "title": "Trace and Sketch Anime Photo",
    "description": "Drawing anime characters, easier than ever with our app Trace and Sketch Anime Photo.\r\n\r\nThis trace drawing app is a creative haven for anime enthusiasts and aspiring artists. Unleash your creativity and master drawing art with the draw sketch app. And learning how to draw and sketch anime photos. You just need to take paper and a pencil, choose the anime you like and start tracing. The drawing sketch app is very easy to use.\r\n\r\nKey features of the draw easy trace to sketch and tracing app:\r\n\u270d\ufe0f Sketch:\r\n- Learn how to sketch just using pencil and paper then choose your drawing tutorial from popular categories. The picture drawing app provides tools and features to enhance your sketching experience.\r\n- Perfect way to make a perfect sketch.\r\n- How to sketch photo: \r\n+ Import photo from gallery or choose image from category.\r\n+ Apply effects: opacity, flip, lock screen, flashlight...\r\n+ Prop up the phone using a sturdy surface and start sketching. You can record when sketching\r\n\r\n\u270d\ufe0f Trace:\r\n- Elevate your anime artistry with the draw trace and sketch app. Easily trace over existing images to capture the intricate details of your favorite photo.\r\n- Trace any image using the camera\r\n- How to trace photo:\r\n+ Import photo from gallery or choose image from category.\r\n+ Zoom and drag images within a designated area for precise positioning\r\n+ Align the paper with the image on your phone for tracing\r\n\r\n\u270d\ufe0f Collection of Categories:\r\n- Access a vast and diverse category of photos within the anime trace sketch app. Explore a variety of images to trace and sketch: anime, cartoon, animals, people, hair, princess...\r\n\r\n\u270d\ufe0f Customizable Tools:\r\nTailor your artistic process with customizable sketching and tracing tools. Adjust opacity to match your preferences and artistic style. The ar drawing sketch and paint anime app ensures a personalized and intuitive experience for artists of all levels.\r\n\r\nDrawing anime with the draw sketch and trace anime app is easy way to become an anime artist, you can choose your next drawing tutorial by voting for your favorite one. You can draw anything you want on any surface \r\n\r\nNeed Help or Have Questions about trace to sketch anime? Please contact us or leave a comment below. Thanks for using the sketch line effect app.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Drawing anime characters, easier than ever with our app Trace and Sketch Anime Photo.<br><br>This trace drawing app is a creative haven for anime enthusiasts and aspiring artists. Unleash your creativity and master drawing art with the draw sketch app. And learning how to draw and sketch anime photos. You just need to take paper and a pencil, choose the anime you like and start tracing. The drawing sketch app is very easy to use.<br><br>Key features of the draw easy trace to sketch and tracing app:<br>\u270d\ufe0f Sketch:<br>- Learn how to sketch just using pencil and paper then choose your drawing tutorial from popular categories. The picture drawing app provides tools and features to enhance your sketching experience.<br>- Perfect way to make a perfect sketch.<br>- How to sketch photo: <br>+ Import photo from gallery or choose image from category.<br>+ Apply effects: opacity, flip, lock screen, flashlight...<br>+ Prop up the phone using a sturdy surface and start sketching. You can record when sketching<br><br>\u270d\ufe0f Trace:<br>- Elevate your anime artistry with the draw trace and sketch app. Easily trace over existing images to capture the intricate details of your favorite photo.<br>- Trace any image using the camera<br>- How to trace photo:<br>+ Import photo from gallery or choose image from category.<br>+ Zoom and drag images within a designated area for precise positioning<br>+ Align the paper with the image on your phone for tracing<br><br>\u270d\ufe0f Collection of Categories:<br>- Access a vast and diverse category of photos within the anime trace sketch app. Explore a variety of images to trace and sketch: anime, cartoon, animals, people, hair, princess...<br><br>\u270d\ufe0f Customizable Tools:<br>Tailor your artistic process with customizable sketching and tracing tools. Adjust opacity to match your preferences and artistic style. The ar drawing sketch and paint anime app ensures a personalized and intuitive experience for a